00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:14,240
are closer than ever now.

291
00:11:15,150 --> 00:11:16,480
That's only temporary.

292
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:17,670
Right.

293
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:19,360
I sent my dad,

294
00:11:19,980 --> 00:11:20,750
my own father,

295
00:11:20,750 --> 00:11:21,270
away.

296
00:11:21,770 --> 00:11:22,670
He will never come back.

297
00:11:22,670 --> 00:11:23,320
I sent

298
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:24,760
