305
00:11:38,550 --> 00:11:39,000
Dad.

306
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:41,270
Sit, sit, sit.

307
00:11:45,150 --> 00:11:47,280
I don't know what Mr. Huang sees in you.

308
00:11:47,540 --> 00:11:48,960
You can't get anything right,

309
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,690
