318
00:12:22,270 --> 00:12:23,800
You all have to listen to me.

319
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:27,570
Understood.

320
00:12:28,790 --> 00:12:29,470
If you hear anything,

321
00:12:29,470 --> 00:12:30,870
