326
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:37,790
Stuck.

327
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:39,670
Keep me posted.

328
00:12:39,670 --> 00:12:40,400
Understood.

329
00:12:41,550 --> 00:12:42,610
Take care, Mr. Gao.

330
00:12:51,290 --> 00:12:52,750
Don't eat too much of this.

331
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:07,800
Here it is.

332
00:13:08,360 --> 00:13:08,750
Here.

333
00:13:08,970 --> 00:13:11,500
Have some fish balls
while they're still hot.

334
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:12,200
Thank you, thank you.

335
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:13,960
Ms. Lin, eat it while it's hot.

336
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:14,720
Have some
while you wait for Mr. Zhou.

337
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:15,450
-Okay.
-Eat.

338
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:18,060
Done changing?

339
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:18,810
How is it?

340
00:13:18,810 --> 00:13:20,010
Do my clothes fit you?

341
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:20,740
They're...

342
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:22,270
They're okay. They're just... a little...

343
00:13:22,270 --> 00:13:23,030
a little long.

344
00:13:23,030 --> 00:13:24,630
The pants are a little loose.

345
00:13:26,030 --> 00:13:26,670
Mr. Zhou.

346
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,120
From today on,

347
00:13:28,910 --> 00:13:29,790
we're

348
00:13:29,790 --> 00:13:31,320
like brothers.

349
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,120
Yes, yes.

350
00:13:33,710 --> 00:13:35,840
I, Chen Jiahao, give you my word today.

351
00:13:36,670 --> 00:13:37,720
You can wear anything

352
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,050
in the wardrobe at home.

353
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:41,170
My wardrobe.

354
00:13:41,550 --> 00:13:41,910
Okay.

355
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:42,790
Okay.

356
00:13:42,790 --> 00:13:43,910
It's fine. I'll just

357
00:13:43,910 --> 00:13:45,440
wear them for a while to get by.

358
00:13:45,440 --> 00:13:46,670
My clothes are all...

359
00:13:46,670 --> 00:13:47,240
Mr. Zhou,

360
00:13:47,440 --> 00:13:48,440
there was no time to cook,

361
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,670
so I just heated up some fish balls.

362
00:13:49,670 --> 00:13:50,870
Just make do with them.

363
00:13:50,870 --> 00:13:52,550
Just consider this
a small welcome-back meal for you.

364
00:13:52,550 --> 00:13:53,600
There is nothing small about this.

365
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:54,080
To be honest,

366
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,360
