367
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:56,870
Yeah, we really like this.

368
00:13:58,790 --> 00:13:59,750
As long as you like it.

369
00:13:59,750 --> 00:14:00,510
Delicious.

370
00:14:00,510 --> 00:14:01,510
That's the taste.

371
00:14:02,790 --> 00:14:03,360
So good.

372
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,510
What a welcome.

373
00:14:08,140 --> 00:14:09,400
As soon as we came back,

374
00:14:10,150 --> 00:14:11,360
Mr. Chen passed away.

375
00:14:14,630 --> 00:14:15,150
No,

376
00:14:15,390 --> 00:14:17,080
he's just gone.

377
00:14:17,630 --> 00:14:18,550
That's not right, either.

378
00:14:18,550 --> 00:14:19,150
He just

379
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,600
vanished.

380
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:21,150
He quit.

381
00:14:21,420 --> 00:14:22,940
Right, he quit.

382
00:14:23,870 --> 00:14:25,530
It's all Chen Junnan's fault.

383
00:14:25,750 --> 00:14:27,810
I think he's definitely behind this.

384
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:30,150
Actually,

385
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:32,720
I was just thinking about it.

386
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:34,030
Let

387
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:35,570
bygones be bygones.

388
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:37,050
We have to move forward.

389
00:14:38,150 --> 00:14:38,870
Since

390
00:14:38,890 --> 00:14:41,200
our village has
the real-life Yin Tinchiu,

391
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:41,910
maybe

392
00:14:41,910 --> 00:14:43,600
the people who inspired
the other characters

393
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:45,870
might also be hiding
right here in our village.

394
00:14:45,870 --> 00:14:46,450
Right.

395
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:47,870
Are there

396
00:14:47,870 --> 00:14:49,390
any other people
who inspired the other characters?

397
00:14:49,390 --> 00:14:50,510
We can just keep making videos with them.

398
00:14:50,510 --> 00:14:51,390
To be honest,

399
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:54,080
since Mr. Chen's video

400
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,510
went viral online,

401
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,320
all our villagers,

402
00:14:57,630 --> 00:14:58,510
well,

403
00:14:58,510 --> 00:14:59,480
rushed to copy him.

404
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:00,720
-And it was
-It's a good thing.

405
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:01,920
