406
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,750
Ms. Zicai in our village

407
00:15:05,150 --> 00:15:06,320
posted a video

408
00:15:06,420 --> 00:15:08,480
claiming to be the inspiration for Dujuan.

409
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:10,940
She suffered overwhelming
cyberbullying.

410
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:13,910
It seems

411
00:15:14,150 --> 00:15:16,000
this path really won't work.

412
00:15:19,270 --> 00:15:19,800
How about

413
00:15:20,050 --> 00:15:20,720
we just

414
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:22,480
do the same thing

415
00:15:22,750 --> 00:15:23,390
and make another one?

416
00:15:23,390 --> 00:15:24,360
No.

417
00:15:24,550 --> 00:15:26,630
Even if we could pull off
a fake like this,

418
00:15:26,630 --> 00:15:27,960
it might not work,

419
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:30,450
and we could end up hurting the villagers.

420
00:15:31,150 --> 00:15:32,240
Don't fake things

421
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:33,750
or take some shady shortcut.

422
00:15:33,750 --> 00:15:35,150
I'm with Ms. Zhen on this.

423
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,000
To be honest,

424
00:15:39,550 --> 00:15:41,790
I really did it for my house at first.

425
00:15:42,390 --> 00:15:44,790
But now that the villagers
trust us so much,

426
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:47,120
we can't let them down.

427
00:15:48,670 --> 00:15:50,200
Do you have any other ideas?

428
00:15:53,200 --> 00:15:55,460
Then we might have to think this through.

429
00:15:56,150 --> 00:15:57,670
But not for too long.

430
00:15:57,670 --> 00:15:58,320
Mr. Zhou.

431
00:15:58,550 --> 00:16:01,480
After all, Mr. Chen's popularity
will pass quickly.

432
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:03,090
We can't keep relying on you

433
00:16:03,390 --> 00:16:05,550
dancing shirtless to get views,

434
00:16:05,550 --> 00:16:06,390
can we?

435
00:16:06,390 --> 00:16:06,720
Yes.

436
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:07,630
Zhou Ke.

437
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:09,510
Mr. Zhou.

438
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:10,840
This is...

439
00:16:10,910 --> 00:16:11,720
Mr. Shark.

440
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:13,320
-Hello, Mr. Shark.
-Hello, Mr. Shark.

441
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,200
You... well...

442
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,320
well...

443
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:19,020
