444
00:16:20,790 --> 00:16:21,840
Let me tell you.

445
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:22,840
Thank you.

446
00:16:23,150 --> 00:16:24,270
Thank you.

447
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,280
You know what?

448
00:16:26,390 --> 00:16:27,200
My daughter

449
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:28,690
has been living in the city for many years

450
00:16:28,690 --> 00:16:29,820
and never came back.

451
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:30,750
Now,

452
00:16:31,030 --> 00:16:32,200
