453
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:34,600
that our Shapu Village is popular,

454
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:37,200
and now she wants to come back
and open a guesthouse.

455
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:38,460
Jiajia is coming back?

456
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:39,240
Yes.

457
00:16:39,510 --> 00:16:40,320
Here.

458
00:16:41,150 --> 00:16:41,750
Take it.

459
00:16:41,910 --> 00:16:42,550
No, I can't.

460
00:16:42,550 --> 00:16:43,000
I can't take it.

461
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:43,600
Take it.

462
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:44,270
Keep it.

463
00:16:44,270 --> 00:16:45,000
Keep it.

464
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:45,660
You keep it.

465
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:46,600
Let me tell you,

466
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:48,960
these are the clothes my daughter wore
when she was little.

467
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:50,200
They are very good.

468
00:16:51,270 --> 00:16:52,600
Pick whatever you like.

469
00:16:52,670 --> 00:16:53,000
Pick?

470
00:16:53,150 --> 00:16:54,150
Pick some to wear?

471
00:16:54,270 --> 00:16:55,150
No need, sir.

472
00:16:55,510 --> 00:16:57,150
My daughter is coming back.

473
00:16:57,440 --> 00:16:59,550
My daughter is coming back!

474
00:16:59,550 --> 00:17:01,000
Take it easy, sir. Take care.

475
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,060
Careful, careful.

476
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:04,130
My daughter is coming back.

477
00:17:04,589 --> 00:17:05,069
That's great.

478
00:17:05,069 --> 00:17:06,130
He is so nice to you.

479
00:17:06,230 --> 00:17:07,160
Go back and pick some to wear.

480
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:07,589
Right.

481
00:17:09,589 --> 00:17:10,880
I learned 3 things

482
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:12,440
from what happened with Mr. Shark.

483
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:13,240
What are they?

484
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:13,680
First,

485
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:15,240
Mr. Zhou's influence

486
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:16,160
is very great.

487
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:16,400
Yes.

488
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:18,750
You're the pride of Shapu Village now.

489
00:17:19,550 --> 00:17:20,510
This dance—

490
00:17:20,869 --> 00:17:23,480
everyone in the village, young
and old, knows this dance.

491
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,160
Second,

492
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:24,960
you know what?

493
00:17:25,069 --> 00:17:25,960
A reporter today

494
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:28,069
