asking about Mr. Zhou.

495
00:17:28,069 --> 00:17:28,640
Look at that.

496
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:29,200
Third,

497
00:17:29,550 --> 00:17:31,640
everyone says you're not very tall,

498
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,270
but you've got incredible explosive power.

499
00:17:33,270 --> 00:17:34,160
Wait.

500
00:17:35,750 --> 00:17:38,110
You just said a reporter were looking
for me from door to door?

501
00:17:38,110 --> 00:17:38,440
Yes.

502
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:39,320
Did they want to interview me?

503
00:17:39,320 --> 00:17:39,850
Yes.

504
00:17:40,110 --> 00:17:40,830
Really?

505
00:17:44,110 --> 00:17:44,910
I have an idea.

506
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:47,370
I know how to expand our influence.

507
00:17:47,550 --> 00:17:49,160
Do you have that reporter's contact info?

508
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:49,640
Yes.

509
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:50,560
Call them.

510
00:17:56,880 --> 00:18:00,470
Stop it!

511
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:02,350
That's some serious power from your core!

512
00:18:02,350 --> 00:18:02,950
All right.

513
00:18:03,030 --> 00:18:04,030
That's a good one.

514
00:18:04,070 --> 00:18:05,590
L-Let's go over it one more time.

515
00:18:05,590 --> 00:18:05,920
Okay.

516
00:18:06,310 --> 00:18:06,790
Okay.

517
00:18:07,270 --> 00:18:09,440
Go back!

518
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:10,050
Good.

519
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:10,760
Very good.

520
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:14,180
You two.

521
00:18:15,510 --> 00:18:16,720
Mr. Gao, what brings you here

522
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:17,550
so late?

523
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:19,590
I have something

524
00:18:19,590 --> 00:18:20,720
to talk to you about.

525
00:18:21,310 --> 00:18:22,310
We'll have to pass.

526
00:18:22,310 --> 00:18:23,890
It's time for us to get off work.

527
00:18:23,890 --> 00:18:24,400
No, I mean...

528
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:25,590
What time do you get off work?

529
00:18:25,590 --> 00:18:27,440
Those guys are still working there.

530
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:28,310
Sorry.

531
00:18:28,550 --> 00:18:30,350
We should get off work.

532
00:18:31,830 --> 00:18:33,740
I'm sorry.

533
00:18:33,830 --> 00:18:35,550
Let's talk about it tomorrow.

534
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:37,600
It's okay.

535
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:39,370
Please

536
00:18:39,390 --> 00:18:41,320
come to my mobile office for a chat.

537
00:18:45,840 --> 00:18:46,880
Office?

538
00:18:51,630 --> 00:18:53,360
I won't go to that kind of place.

539
00:18:57,400 --> 00:18:59,030
Your mobile office

540
00:18:59,220 --> 00:19:00,260
is quite small.

541
00:19:02,310 --> 00:19:02,750
Okay.

542
00:19:02,750 --> 00:19:04,160
Chief, let's eat.

543
00:19:04,800 --> 00:19:05,670
I'll pass.

544
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:06,960
We have discipline.

545
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:08,690
Just get straight to the point.

546
00:19:09,830 --> 00:19:10,270
No.

547
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:13,240
Back then, when you went to such lengths

548
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:15,160
to get us to bring in investors,

549
00:19:15,570 --> 00:19:16,970
you weren't saying that.

550
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:19,350
You can't say that.

551
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:22,070
It was Mr. Huang

552
00:19:22,070 --> 00:19:24,550
who approached me first back then, right?

553
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:27,200
It doesn't matter who made the first move.

554
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:29,260
Didn't you give us your full support?

555
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:30,590
Yes.

556
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:31,830
Then you can't just turn around
and change your mind

557
00:19:31,830 --> 00:19:33,160
now that Zhen and the others

558
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:34,360
have finally got things going.

559
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:36,490
Doesn't that make you a fence-sitter?

560
00:19:36,550 --> 00:19:37,640
Don't say that.

561
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:39,500
I am the village chief.

562
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:40,440
So

563
00:19:40,750 --> 00:19:43,650
