568
00:19:49,030 --> 00:19:49,750
No, no, no.

569
00:19:49,830 --> 00:19:50,790
That's not what I mean.

570
00:19:50,790 --> 00:19:51,990
Then what do you mean?

571
00:19:55,030 --> 00:19:56,350
Y-You two

572
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:58,980
are overthinking.

573
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:00,070
You see,

574
00:20:00,070 --> 00:20:01,880
I am just a village chief,

575
00:20:02,240 --> 00:20:02,790
right?

576
00:20:02,790 --> 00:20:03,750
What am I?

577
00:20:04,350 --> 00:20:05,880
If the villagers support you,

578
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:06,920
you're somebody.

579
00:20:07,480 --> 00:20:09,200
If the villagers don't support you,

580
00:20:09,200 --> 00:20:10,310
you're nobody.

581
00:20:10,550 --> 00:20:12,270
No, don't say that to me.

582
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:15,400
Okay, in that case,

583
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:17,400
